# shell: desktop
# apps: fixture3
# AW-048: Open With rows group by how well they match, and a rule stands
# where the order changes meaning -- exact, then supertype, then anything.
wait 10
click-row 1 3
wait 3
menu-pick Open with
wait 3
note the shipped Editor reads every text there is, so it stands in the
note middle group beside the registered one that claims the same
expect-menu Stamper (opens this type)||Editor (opens this kind of file)|Texty (opens this kind of file)||Anything (opens anything)
quit
